Comment: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:00.98,Comment,,0,0,0,,——Title——
Comment: 0,0:00:01.02,0:00:01.02,Comment,,0,0,0,,——Text——
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.94,0:00:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,把暑假的时间交给紬?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.31,0:00:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然是我擅自决定的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.23,0:00:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但我希望静久你也能一起来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.74,0:00:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.16,0:00:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,静久…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.91,0:00:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这种事…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.58,0:00:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,呣啾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.70,0:00:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,当然是没问题啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.54,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要把暑假剩下的时间全部给紬
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.79,0:00:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,最喜欢你了  静久
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.21,0:00:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是哦  紬
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.21,0:00:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,呣啾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你  静久
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,要说谢谢的应该是我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.76,0:00:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你提出了这么棒的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就一起尽情享受暑假吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.01,0:00:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗  紬
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.43,0:00:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.27,0:00:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,紬?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.23,0:00:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,呣啾…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.10,0:00:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样  我们真正的暑假开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.91,0:02:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,评客
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.70,0:02:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,然后还有阳台
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.04,0:02:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  我有点不明白你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.29,0:02:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,评客  是之前捡垃圾时找到的…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.67,0:02:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,之前因为没办法分类所以一直没扔掉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.63,0:02:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但昨晚我突然想到一个主意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.93,0:02:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,用来做成阳台
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.26,0:02:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,回收利用
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,让空的评客罐子成为阳台
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.39,0:02:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么是阳台呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.94,0:02:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我想要阳台
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.23,0:02:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,但是站在那上面会压坏掉下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.44,0:02:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不要紧的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.03,0:03:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,评客是无敌的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.07,0:03:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,可是要做阳台的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.24,0:03:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,罐子的数量还差很多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.37,0:03:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那我现在拿过来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.46,0:03:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来开作战会议吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.54,0:03:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微等我一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.46,0:03:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,用评客做阳台吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.05,0:03:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,真是厉害的想法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.22,0:03:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,很符合紬的风格
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.26,0:03:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,但我现在还是无法相信
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.43,0:03:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,夏天结束后  就见不到紬了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.35,0:03:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,总之现在  我想把时间都花在紬身上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.82,0:03:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是这个夏天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.73,0:03:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我想做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.78,0:03:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢上紬了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.82,0:03:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,完全着迷了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.78,0:03:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,紬也是  不知从什么时候起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.28,0:03:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,从鹰原同学改口成羽依里同学了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.12,0:03:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你…你在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.16,0:03:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是希望紬能开心  仅此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我说啊  这种感情就叫做喜欢哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.01,0:04:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但…但是这样也太突然了…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.93,0:04:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,恋爱总是突如其来的哦  羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.18,0:04:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,果然…是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.06,0:04:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢紬
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.86,0:04:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,紬?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.06,0:04:17.40,Comment,,0,0,0,,呣啾…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.82,0:04:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里同学  你喜欢我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.36,0:04:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,啊  这个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.07,0:04:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.62,0:04:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,样子看起来有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.16,0:04:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,呣啾
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.99,0:04:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,当然会奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.58,0:04:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次有男孩子说喜欢我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.33,0:04:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我好害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.38,0:04:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,呣啾
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,要是被甩了我可以把欧派借你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以尽情地哭哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.68,0:04:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.25,0:05:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.87,0:05:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,现在还不要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.46,0:05:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是海胆炒饭
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.05,0:05:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你在听吗  羽依里哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.68,0:05:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不行  我怎么能沮丧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.14,0:05:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这样下去只会给紬留下难堪的回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.77,0:05:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,振作起来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.02,0:05:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,鹰原羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.81,0:05:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好  羽依里同学
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.23,0:05:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,哎?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.90,0:05:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,呣啾
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.24,0:05:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,今天也是好天气呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.57,0:05:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天羽依里同学说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.32,0:05:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,她好像要当做没发生过
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,要借你欧派吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.04,0:05:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.33,0:06:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,呣啾
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.59,0:06:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.84,0:06:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.93,0:06:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.05,0:06:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,哟
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.18,0:06:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,水…水织学姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.10,0:06:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊  加纳同学
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.02,0:06:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是  学姐也别来无恙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.02,0:06:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,学姐?  你说静久吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.89,0:06:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.44,0:06:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,居然直呼学姐名字
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.48,0:06:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.77,0:06:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静点  天善
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.77,0:06:23.98,Comment,,0,0,0,,你以为自己是哪根葱…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.28,0:06:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,鹰原  你不知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.82,0:06:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,水织学姐在全校的人望很高
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.95,0:06:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,还是我们学校的学生会长哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.28,0:06:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,哪有
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.54,0:06:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我不过是一对欧派而已
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.54,0:06:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你们看  她刚刚也说了欧派
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,啊?  你在说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,水织学姐怎么可能胡乱说这种话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.84,0:06:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你就那么想看欧派吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,真拿你没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.55,0:06:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,在水织学姐面前成何体统
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:54.85,Comment,,0,0,0,,呣啾
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.02,0:06:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不准脱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.73,0:07:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,话说回来  这组合还真是稀奇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.82,0:07:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没见过紬和水织学姐以外的人在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.57,0:07:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.78,0:07:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不过  说起稀奇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.82,0:07:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,紬本身就是个稀有角色
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.16,0:07:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,在岛上很少看见她
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,她总是给人一种虚无缥缈的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.87,0:07:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,让人放心不下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.96,0:07:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到还偏偏是和你一起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.71,0:07:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,到底发生什么了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.96,0:07:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.30,0:07:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,什么也没发生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.05,0:07:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么气氛变这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.47,0:07:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,所以今天是要来干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.22,0:07:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.85,0:07:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,其实…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.10,0:07:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.60,0:07:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,大伙都来帮忙收集评客罐子了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.69,0:07:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.57,0:07:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,而且棉花糖也一如既往地好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.45,0:07:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里同学  分你一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.70,0:07:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,啊——
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.62,0:07:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.83,0:08:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,来  啊——
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.37,0:08:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,啊——
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.84,0:08:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,来  静久
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.21,0:08:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,啊——
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.92,0:08:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.05,0:08:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.88,0:08:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好吃到脸颊都要化了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我交给紬的这个暑假
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,她寻找想做的事的夏天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.99,0:08:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样一天天过去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,为了建阳台而收集评客罐子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,调查有没有人知道紬哼唱的歌曲
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.01,0:08:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,呣啾
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.85,0:09:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你  加纳同学
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.22,0:09:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  这是我的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.10,0:09:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,除了这些还做了很多事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.27,0:09:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,三人的愉快时光…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.03,0:09:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,只属于我们的…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.24,0:09:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,特别的夏天…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.91,0:09:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,渐渐流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你好  西瓜冰棒小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.71,0:09:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,啊  棉花糖小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.51,0:09:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你好  鸣濑同学
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.88,0:09:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.14,0:09:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,给你  老样子的伴手礼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.77,0:09:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.56,0:09:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,真意外
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.98,0:09:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,紬和白羽居然认识
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我和西瓜冰棒小姐是在这里认识的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.07,0:09:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就让我来重现相遇的那一天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.49,0:10:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,钓得到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.62,0:10:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.37,0:10:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,钓得到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.49,0:10:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,啊  那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.95,0:10:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,还行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.66,0:10:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这是鱼的名字吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.12,0:10:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不  是勉强还行的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.25,0:10:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.26,0:10:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,钓到的话会吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我会吃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.22,0:10:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.59,0:10:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得最好吃的东西是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.89,0:10:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,西瓜冰棒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.39,0:10:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,咦  这能钓到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.02,0:10:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,钓不到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.14,0:10:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,在零食店有卖
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.06,0:10:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.23,0:10:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢棉花糖
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.65,0:10:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.87,0:10:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,突然想吃西瓜冰棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.33,0:10:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想吃棉花糖
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.42,0:10:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就是这样认识的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,偶尔我会带西瓜冰棒过来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.13,0:10:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你的西瓜冰棒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.09,0:11:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,居然能交流啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.26,0:11:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.55,0:11:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  我们现在是永远的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.97,0:11:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,才不是永远的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.93,0:11:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,呣啾?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.64,0:11:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,评客…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.19,0:11:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我家里没有那东西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.31,0:11:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.44,0:11:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不过  如果有机会吃到的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.32,0:11:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我会带空罐子给你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,呣啾
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.61,0:11:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.20,0:11:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你  白羽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.87,0:11:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,又不是为了你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.37,0:11:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说是没错…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.59,0:11:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.39,0:11:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  评客已经卖完了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.39,0:11:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我们今天不是为这个来的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.64,0:11:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我要棉花糖
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.60,0:11:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我想想…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.10,0:11:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,空门苍
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.77,0:11:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,空·门·苍
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.32,0:11:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字肯定记得吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.82,0:11:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我想想…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.15,0:12:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,裸~体~的~人~
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.61,0:12:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那根本不是名字
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.41,0:12:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,空~门~苍~
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.83,0:12:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,被波及了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.08,0:12:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.33,0:12:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,苍同学
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.45,0:12:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,而且还记住了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.67,0:12:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,派依里  借一步说话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.05,0:12:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,送给紬的礼物吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.55,0:12:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不不  我已经被甩了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.89,0:12:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没有被当回事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.39,0:12:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这种时候诚实地表达自己的感情是最好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.81,0:12:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,把手放在自己的欧派上听听
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.02,0:12:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,而且暑假一结束
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.69,0:12:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,就要和紬分开了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.07,0:12:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,既然这样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.86,0:12:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,至少是能留下这个夏天的回忆的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但是在这种地方有什么东西能当礼物…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.00,0:12:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这里可是什么都有哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.75,0:12:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊  婆婆
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.23,0:13:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里同学  静久
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.89,0:13:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你们刚才在聊什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.27,0:13:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.90,0:13:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,呣啾?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.15,0:13:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,可疑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.53,0:13:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦  紬
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.94,0:13:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你接下来想做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.74,0:13:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,有的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.70,0:13:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我想去羽依里同学家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.95,0:13:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我家?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.08,0:13:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才苍同学说了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.58,0:13:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,想跟在意的人进一步加深关系的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.25,0:13:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,最快的方式就是去他房间
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.33,0:13:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定能找到藏起来的色色的书
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.21,0:13:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,她这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.92,0:13:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但是突然去的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.26,0:13:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道镜子阿姨会说什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.31,0:13:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里哥承蒙你们照顾了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.77,0:13:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢你们的款待
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.69,0:13:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们才是要受你们照顾了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.86,0:14:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,过来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.03,0:14:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,所以呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.82,0:14:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,上次过夜是哪个女生邀请你的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.28,0:14:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是金发的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.03,0:14:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不过实际上是三人一起过夜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.28,0:14:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,脚踏两船
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.49,0:14:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这…这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.58,0:14:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,必须要联系姐姐了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.66,0:14:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了别啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.59,0:14:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这里就是羽依里同学的房间吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.42,0:14:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,呣啾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.84,0:14:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微有些紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,虽说是我的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.43,0:14:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,但也只是这个夏天借用一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.06,0:14:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,派依里很懂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.14,0:14:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,呣啾?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.81,0:14:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不  这是朋友硬塞给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.82,0:14:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,派依里  你能出去一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.83,0:14:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.33,0:15:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,呣啾
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.67,0:15:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉硬邦邦的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.46,0:15:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,觉得怎么样  羽依里同学
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你问怎么样…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.01,0:15:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,里面塞了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.84,0:15:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,呣啾啾…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.68,0:15:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,呣啾
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.97,0:15:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,呣啾…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.60,0:15:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.73,0:15:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,可以打扰下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.27,0:15:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,果然必须联系姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.15,0:15:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,都说了不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.82,0:15:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.20,0:15:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:37.83,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs35}注 : 《Klein Irmchen》是德国一本经典的儿童诗歌
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.08,0:15:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,童谣集
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.50,0:15:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说紬在找以前的歌
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.75,0:15:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,所以这个说不定能派上用场
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.33,0:15:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢您  镜子阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.09,0:15:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这里面说不定有紬唱的歌
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.26,0:15:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.59,0:15:54.34,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs26}注 : 《Ich bin ein Musikante》（《我是一名音乐家》又译作《吟游诗人》）是一首德国民谣 并未收录于《Klein Irmchen》中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.22,0:15:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,看不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.51,0:15:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是德语
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.35,0:15:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,完全不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.93,0:16:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,能借我看看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.03,0:16:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.90,0:16:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,对  就是我最喜欢的那首歌
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.95,0:16:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,终于找到了呢  紬
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.29,0:16:23.83,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs24}注 : 《Die Vogelhochzeit》（《鸟的婚礼》）最著名的德国民歌和儿歌之一  是关于两只鸟的婚姻的故事  未收录于《Klein Irmchen》中
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.37,0:16:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,呣啾…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.58,0:16:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话根本看不清在唱什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.54,0:16:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话  就由紬来作词吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.55,0:16:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我来?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.50,0:16:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来很有趣  试试吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.80,0:16:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.55,0:16:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但是  感觉有点难
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.26,0:16:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,总之先想想自己喜欢的东西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.64,0:16:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定能变成符合紬风格的歌词
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.77,0:16:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.56,0:16:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,呣啾啾…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.65,0:16:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,非常非常感谢您
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.11,0:16:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,没事  能帮上忙真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.91,0:16:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,有空再来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.33,0:16:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.91,0:17:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,回去路上小心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.66,0:17:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.25,0:17:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,派依里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.58,0:17:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你晚上睡得不好我先道歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.58,0:17:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.63,0:17:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才紬的胸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.38,0:17:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,找不到合适的填充物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,就用了派依里的枕头
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.55,0:17:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我的枕头
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.80,0:17:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,塞进紬的胸…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.02,0:17:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,振作点  鹰原羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.44,0:17:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,加油啊  紬·文德斯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.94,0:17:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,欧派  水织静久
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.54,0:17:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,鹰原  羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.87,0:17:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,紬·文德斯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.25,0:17:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,水织  静久
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.67,0:17:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,鹰原  羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.21,0:17:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,紬·文德斯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.13,0:17:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,水织  静久
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.90,0:18:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,真可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.86,0:18:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,果然是哼歌的大姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.53,0:18:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,大家?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.49,0:18:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,给你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.54,0:18:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,静久也一起来多好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.79,0:18:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.33,0:18:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我要早点回家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.71,0:18:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,之后就交给你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.67,0:18:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,她在操什么心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.97,0:18:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,请问…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.34,0:18:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,要去逛逛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.35,0:18:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,紬原来一直看到的是这样的景色啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.69,0:18:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.85,0:18:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我喜欢的景色
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.62,0:19:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.37,0:19:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我终于做好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.75,0:19:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,心理准备
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.96,0:19:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,心理准备?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.79,0:19:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.96,0:19:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我也喜欢你哦  羽依里同学
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.13,0:19:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前也说过喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.30,0:19:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,平易近人所以特别喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.35,0:19:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那是作为朋友的喜欢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.93,0:19:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,当时确实是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.73,0:19:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.27,0:19:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,也有另一层含义
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.27,0:19:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,自从你说要将暑假全部交给我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.19,0:19:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,听到你那样说
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.07,0:19:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我就喜欢上了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.57,0:19:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,所以  为了不让心一直跳
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.74,0:19:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在羽依里同学前面表现得很平常
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.50,0:19:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但根本不行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.96,0:19:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,现在心也一直在跳
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.67,0:19:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,紬…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.42,0:19:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.17,0:20:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上就要回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.72,0:20:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,就算说喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.14,0:20:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有意义
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.44,0:20:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,分开的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.40,0:20:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝对会大哭一场
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.65,0:20:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想要那样的分别
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.28,0:20:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.03,0:20:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.74,0:20:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你说出来了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.71,0:20:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,因为要分开
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.42,0:20:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,就会失去意义吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.67,0:20:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,呣啾?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.17,0:20:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,就算知道要分别
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.51,0:20:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就算再也见不到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.47,0:20:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得这份感情也不会失去意义
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.76,0:20:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不论发生多么痛苦的事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.85,0:20:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢这份情感是不会变的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.81,0:20:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,让我想起这件事的人就是你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.19,0:20:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.11,0:21:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.69,0:21:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.03,0:21:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是要好好说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.41,0:21:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.28,0:21:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里同学  我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.63,0:21:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我最喜欢羽依里同学了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.51,0:21:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我回来了  镜子阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.10,0:21:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.64,0:21:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去很开心呢  羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.73,0:21:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是…是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.57,0:21:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我也来帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.57,0:21:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.66,0:21:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,紬?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.71,0:22:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那一天
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.71,0:22:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,紬从我们面前消失了
Comment: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:00.98,Comment,,0,0,0,,

